        "focus": ["local-user", "vue-workbench", "access-policy", "hono-api", "runtime-coordinator", "pi-sdk", "pi-jsonl"],
        "note": "从本地浏览器命令进入 Gateway，经公平调度后由固定版本 Pi SDK 执行并写回 Pi 原生 Session。"
      },
      {
        "id": "realtime-sync",
        "label": "多 Session 实时同步",
        "focus": ["hono-api", "sync-controller", "vue-workbench"],
        "note": "一个 Gateway 级 SSE 连接复用所有 Session；游标缺口、epoch 变化或背压触发快照恢复。"
      },
      {
        "id": "session-persistence",
        "label": "Session 真相与投影",
        "focus": ["pi-jsonl", "projection-coordinator", "app-sqlite", "hono-api"],
        "note": "Pi JSONL 拥有 Transcript 真相；SQLite 只保存应用状态与可重建投影，并以 generation 原子切换。"
      },
      {
        "id": "local-security",
        "label": "本地安全边界",
        "focus": ["local-user", "vue-workbench", "access-policy", "hono-api", "app-sqlite"],
        "note": "随机 loopback、一次性 fragment bootstrap、Cookie/CSRF 与 Workspace Grant 逐层保护 Gateway 资源。"
      },
      {
        "id": "recovery-path",
        "label": "崩溃与恢复路径",
        "focus": ["runtime-coordinator", "app-sqlite", "pi-jsonl", "projection-coordinator", "sync-controller"],
        "note": "非终态 Run 重启后变为 Interrupted；投影可重建；客户端通过 snapshot + cursor 恢复且绝不自动重放。"
      }
    ]
  },
